  ('02393d19-d188-4683-b520-c996d4795547', '0597838360', 'jhs3-soc-t2-weather-climate-vegetation', 'Social Studies', 'Types of Rainfall', 'Which type of rainfall is typically accompanied by thunder, lightning, and towering cumulonimbus clouds on hot afternoons?', 'C', 'B', '2026-10-19 21:52:50.758+00'),
  ('1689deba-0e73-465f-baa5-4db3c047c3d1', '0598460635', 'jhs3-soc-t1-mapping-ghana-environment', 'Social Studies', 'Grid Reference Reading Convention', 'When reading grid coordinates on a topographical map, which lines must always be read first?', 'A', 'B', '2026-10-19 22:19:53.431+00'),
  ('7c84b9ff-16cc-4182-8f32-1bf38feec607', '0598460635', 'jhs3-soc-t1-mapping-ghana-environment', 'Social Studies', 'Representative Fraction (R.F.) Scale Conversion', 'What does a map scale of 1:50,000 represent in physical ground distance?', 'D', 'A', '2026-10-19 22:19:53.255+00'),
  ('127cdd32-fc03-435d-a032-f94f25c017b0', '0598460635', 'jhs3-soc-t1-mapping-ghana-environment', 'Social Studies', 'Longitude and International Time Calculation', 'If the local time at Greenwich (Longitude 0°, Tema, Ghana) is 12:00 noon, what is the local time in Town B located at Longitude 60°E?', 'D', 'C', '2026-10-19 22:19:53.405+00'),
  ('22b6e3e0-8164-4350-8267-b910a0b87b78', '0598460635', 'jhs3-soc-t1-mapping-ghana-environment', 'Social Studies', 'Time Calculation Across Longitude', 'If the local time at Longitude 30°W is 10:00 a.m., what is the local time in Accra, Ghana (Longitude 0°)?', 'A', 'B', '2026-10-19 22:19:53.733+00'),
  ('7247610c-fd59-4dab-a406-b484d5d1767f', '0598460635', 'jhs3-soc-t1-mapping-ghana-environment', 'Social Studies', 'Scale Conversion Calculations', 'Convert the statement scale ''2 cm to 1 km'' into a Representative Fraction (R.F.).', 'C', 'B', '2026-10-19 22:19:54.003+00'),
  ('fa008893-4738-48a1-a7e4-5eb05b452c50', '0598460635', 'jhs3-soc-t1-mapping-ghana-environment', 'Social Studies', 'Ghana''s Major Relief Regions', 'Which major relief feature in Ghana is underlain by ancient gold-bearing Birimian rocks and forms the heart of cocoa and timber production?', 'A', 'C', '2026-10-19 22:19:54.445+00'),
  ('a2c7f492-f8c5-4f65-ad34-633173deeea6', '0557668425', 'jhs3-sci-t1-atomic-structure-bonding', 'Integrated Science', 'Electrical Conductivity in Ionic Compounds', 'Why do solid ionic crystals like sodium chloride fail to conduct electricity?', 'D', 'B', '2026-10-19 23:07:02.718+00'),
  ('5edcf6c5-55cd-41f0-8cb2-025d333a5790', '0557668425', 'jhs3-sci-t1-atomic-structure-bonding', 'Integrated Science', 'Bohr Electron Configuration', 'What is the electronic configuration of a neutral chlorine atom with atomic number 17?', 'C', 'A', '2026-10-19 23:07:02.747+00'),
  ('3b15531a-77dd-4300-b03a-006513103e4a', '0557668425', 'jhs3-sci-t1-atomic-structure-bonding', 'Integrated Science', 'Noble Gases and Octet/Duplet', 'Which of the following elements is a noble (inert) gas with a stable duplet electron configuration?', 'A', 'C', '2026-10-19 23:07:02.719+00'),
  ('46a753e8-ccde-4afa-be23-3000e29cd3e4', '0557668425', 'jhs3-sci-t1-atomic-structure-bonding', 'Integrated Science', 'Covalent Bonding in Molecules', 'How many pairs of electrons are shared between the two nitrogen atoms in a nitrogen molecule (N₂)?', 'B', 'C', '2026-10-19 23:07:03.537+00'),
  ('8fd3efa3-1e6d-4f42-b6bf-8e0c97967924', '0536383278', 'shs3-math-t1-sine-rule', 'Core Mathematics', 'Sine Rule Formula', 'Which formula represents the Sine Rule for any triangle ABC?', 'B', 'A', '2026-10-20 02:48:25.08+00'),
  ('e088a71a-bd76-494f-940f-721743f98eed', '0536383278', 'shs3-math-t1-sine-rule', 'Core Mathematics', 'Inverse Sine', 'In Question 5, since sin P = 1, what is the size of angle P?', 'B', 'A', '2026-10-20 02:48:25.276+00'),
  ('e63e09c5-d6c2-4d76-ad0e-6ba5bb458cb7', '0536383278', 'shs3-math-t1-sine-rule', 'Core Mathematics', 'Third Angle in Triangle', 'In triangle XYZ, angle X = 40°, angle Y = 60°, and side z = 12 cm. What is the size of angle Z?', 'D', 'A', '2026-10-20 02:48:25.257+00'),
  ('a2d2b3bc-9240-448a-909c-7172fdfd4f79', '0536383278', 'shs3-math-t1-sine-rule', 'Core Mathematics', 'Sine of Supplementary Angles', 'What is sin(180° - θ) equal to?', 'C', 'A', '2026-10-20 02:48:25.933+00'),
  ('d9585576-aa43-46e8-859c-8ac0fee63c6f', '0536383278', 'shs3-math-t1-sine-rule', 'Core Mathematics', 'Circumradius and Sine Rule', 'If the circumradius of a circle circumscribing triangle ABC is R = 5 cm, and angle A = 30°, find side a.', 'C', 'A', '2026-10-20 02:48:26.151+00'),
  ('afc3c4bf-de9b-4e15-8f71-53e6db50e3eb', '0536383278', 'shs3-math-t1-sine-rule', 'Core Mathematics', 'Calculating Side with Sine Rule', 'In triangle ABC, angle A = 30°, angle B = 45°, and side a = 8 cm. Find side b.', 'B', 'A', '2026-10-20 02:48:26.083+00'),
  ('5418aee4-9082-418b-8fe6-baec68e33abe', '0536383278', 'shs3-math-t1-sine-rule', 'Core Mathematics', 'Sine Rule vs Cosine Rule Selection', 'Can the Sine Rule be used to solve a triangle where ONLY the three sides are given (a = 5, b = 7, c = 8)?', 'C', 'A', '2026-10-20 02:48:26.34+00'),
  ('bdf7ac1a-a04e-4a77-9107-c4307b809733', '0278358606', 'shs1-math-t1-sets-venn', 'Core Mathematics', 'Disjoint Sets', 'If sets A and B are disjoint, what is n(A ∩ B)?', 'D', 'B', '2026-10-20 12:40:12.051+00'),
  ('39c198fa-0ef8-4366-ab9c-f790dd9c8808', '0278358606', 'shs1-math-t1-sets-venn', 'Core Mathematics', 'Two-Set Venn Inclusion-Exclusion', 'In a class of 50 students, 30 like Yam, 25 like Rice, and 10 like both. How many students like neither?', 'C', 'A', '2026-10-20 12:40:12.226+00'),
  ('b9bc1b0e-3bdd-4df0-8fa4-eed47ea4ed25', '0547154254', 'shs1-em-t1-indices-logarithms', 'Elective Mathematics', 'Logs of Composite Numbers', 'Given log 2 = 0.3010 and log 3 = 0.4771, find log 12.', 'A', 'C', '2026-10-20 14:41:21.55+00'),
  ('5d4eb510-411a-4a58-bb44-e5cf232b1297', '0547154254', 'shs1-em-t1-indices-logarithms', 'Elective Mathematics', 'Negative and Fractional Indices', 'Evaluate 4^(-3/2) times 8^(4/3).', 'B', 'D', '2026-10-20 14:41:21.762+00'),
  ('c3657f76-73b5-4e61-9684-213c5bb9a294', '0547154254', 'shs1-em-t1-indices-logarithms', 'Elective Mathematics', 'Laws of Logarithms', 'Given that log 2 = 0.3010, evaluate 2 log 5 + log 8.', 'C', 'D', '2026-10-20 14:41:21.583+00')
